		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  Code retour d'une instruction sql vide]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=10343#p10343"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Récrivez votre requête comme ceci :</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code>WITH 
T AS
(select count(*) AS N from matab)
SELECT COALESCE((SELECT N FROM T), 0) AS RESULTAT</code></pre></div><p>A</p>]]></content>
